    "description": "Once per round, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, when an enemy moves adjacent to you, you can enable one ally within your line of sight to immediately make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a> attack against the triggering enemy. The ally you choose must be able to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a> the enemy from his or her current square under normal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a> rules.",
